Description: C4 Raven TAK server -- full stack, single package
 A security-hardened fork of the upstream project this is derived from.
 This package installs the whole server: the Raven backend (cloned and built
 with Poetry on first install), the C4 Raven UI frontend (built with
 Yarn and deployed to nginx's webroot), a dedicated certificate
 authority, mediamtx for video streaming, and the systemd units that
 tie it all together.
 .
 Postgres, RabbitMQ, and nginx are pulled in as real package
 dependencies; everything specific to this app (the venv, the CA, the
 first admin account) is set up by this package's postinst script,
 which mirrors the previous curl|bash installer step for step.
